      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUXTON NZ (3) has put two wins together at this venue, leading from wider barriers each time. Tries this longer distance for the first time but should be able to push forward again from a low draw so can land the hat trick. Hard to knock the recent consistency of stablemate OUR SUNSET DELIGHT (5) who returned to the winners' list over this distance here last week, adding to a series of top-two results. More depth here but he draws lower. ARGGGHHH (9) hasn't raced since November but ended last campaign with back-to-back seconds here. Draws wide but goes well fresh with three wins and five placings from 10 attempts and has been readied with two trials. ROCKNROLL HAMMER NZ (11) may need luck from the outside barrier but he is racing well and has recorded a win and a second in two tries at this distance. A lower draw can see a better result from HUNGRY HIPPO (7).",
